0..80 Comment "//! Transport along a composite ending in `ua`: the cubical case table of Cohen,"
81..151 Comment "//! Coquand, Huber and Mörtberg, _Cubical Type Theory: a constructive"
152..195 Comment "//! interpretation of the univalence axiom_"
196..287 Comment "//! [Cohen-2015-cubical_type_theory_a_constructive_interpretation_of_the_univalence_axiom],"
288..367 Comment "//! § 4.5, read at the universe. `Path.step(p, ua(e))` is the transport of `p`"
368..444 Comment "//! along `ua(e)` in `y. Path(Type, a, y)`, and transport along it moves the"
445..524 Comment "//! operand along `p`, then applies the record\'s forward map. A first path that"
525..601 Comment "//! does not compute, as `p` here, is carried on as the value it stands for."
602..605 Comment "//!"
606..705 Comment "//! - cites: [Cohen-2015-cubical_type_theory_a_constructive_interpretation_of_the_univalence_axiom]"
706..709 Comment "//!"
